%So let us now consider a conflict packing $\mathcal{C}$ (which can be computed greedily in polynomial time). Observe that $R[V\setminus V(\mathcal{C})]$ is consistent by maximality of $\mathcal{C}$. This means that there exists a unique tree $T$ such that every rooted triplet of
%$\mathcal{R}[V\setminus V(\mathcal{C})]$ is consistent with $T$. We will use that tree $T$ to embed $R$ and compute a safe partition.
