Let  $R_T = (V, \mathcal{R}, T)$ be an embedded system of rooted triplets and  $\mathcal{P}_T = \{T_1, \dots, T_l\}$ be a tree partition of $T$. If  $t$ is a rooted triplet such that $V(t) \subseteq V(T_i)$ for some $1 \leqslant i \leqslant l$, and $d \in V \setminus V(T_i)$, then $d \notin span(t)$.
\end{observation}

