At the shipping preset the placebo arm finished 2/3 solved, versus 3/3 with the structural hint, so the measured structural lift is \(1/3\). The harness is continuing its diagnostic escalation; none of this can rescue a bare family that the required STEP 4 run solves, but it gives a useful account of where the difficulty sits.
